Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 18 TL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:07.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So cold…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:14.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see that, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:19.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:27.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,See? Isn’t it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s winter, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:35.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:43.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It sure is winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:46.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How’s that? Warm you up some?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:48.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…Warmth of the Cold Wintry Wind.”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:40.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:43.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:44.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What comes after winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:47.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:50.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. We don’t have much time left until spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:52.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:57.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to fill this bottle with\Nconfetti by the time spring comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:02:59.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:06.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t hurry, you won’t be able to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:09.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:13.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And when I woke him up this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.75,0:03:16.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad was sleeping with his stomach sticking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:19.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! My brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:23.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:26.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That guy is here again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:30.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go back home today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:39.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:47.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I’ll call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:50.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven’t taken a step inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve got no right to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:54.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s still harrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:57.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All I’m doing is standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:04.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you can’t trust this preschool with your kids, eh?{}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:13.60,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,This guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:19.88,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,The debt collector from back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:21.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:24.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:25.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:49.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Rikako-chan’s mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:56.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried since you didn’t come today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:01.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, that’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:06.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:10.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll mail you the forms, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:11.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:15.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. That’ll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:21.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell Rikako-chan to stay well for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:28.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Rikako-chan is leaving the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:34.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the third child this month…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:37.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…to leave the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:46.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course the parents would be worried in a situation like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:58.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You can’t just do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.37,0:06:00.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Finish what you started!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:09.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:11.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There’s so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:13.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Doumoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:14.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:18.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just stuff from my place and\Nleftovers from the school festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:21.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:23.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we’ll be able to have a Christmas party this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:26.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to use this as a decoration!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:30.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:33.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t push yourself too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:37.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.23,0:06:38.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:42.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun and Kobato-chan are up on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:53.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei looked really sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:58.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though she’s still the same kind and gentle Sayaka-sensei…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:04.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She looked so very sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:09.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,600)}That person…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:14.39,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,When the deadline comes,\NI’ll be taking down the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:15.68,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,You can’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:18.54,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if the children are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:22.75,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,600)} If you don’t want anyone hurt, you'd better vacate soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:27.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is he going to do something so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:32.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura-san is Sayaka-sensei’s husband, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:34.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of husband is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:36.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:41.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go talk to that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:44.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.02,0:07:47.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:49.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a problem if that man is there, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He won’t understand if you just talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:57.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure he’ll understand if we tell him everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:01.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I said don’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:02.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:06.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just don’t get involved!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:11.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If anyone else leaves, Sayaka-sensei will be sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:14.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:17.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it? Don’t do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:19.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:23.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:32.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:44.92,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,300)}That's the third child this\Nmonth to leave the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:49.79,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,600)}Of course the parents would be worried in a situation like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:52.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.17,0:08:53.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:55.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If there was something to be done,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:57.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure Kiyokazu would have done it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:00.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand how you feel, but you shouldn’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:03.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I still think I should ask him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:05.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Still…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.64,0:09:10.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, Yomogi Preschool will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:11.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone will be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:15.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So I’m going to go talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:22.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.45,0:09:25.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:28.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s put up a lot of snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:29.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.67,0:09:32.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Should we make everything white?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:36.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s put this up together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.76,0:09:41.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ve got these other round things too,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:45.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so let’s put them all around it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:45.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:55.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s that Dobato doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:08.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:11.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The weather sure is nice today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:19.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,On a day like this, it feels really nice to curl up on a fluffy mattress!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:25.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx(96)}We play a lot, take naps on fluffy\Nmattresses, say “see you tomorrow!”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:30.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx(95)}And then tomorrow, we’ll see\Neveryone again at Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:32.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What nonsense are you blabbing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:35.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We went on a picnic too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:37.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We went leaf collecting and made pictures with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Picking potatoes was fun too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:44.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And lots of people came to\Nthe bazaar we had recently!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:52.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This preschool is full… full of everyone’s memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:54.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:58.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t close down Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:10:59.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:03.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then pay back the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:05.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:07.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why we’ll give it back little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:10.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, even if you talk to this guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:16.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:18.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:22.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, like that guy said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:24.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,nothing will change if you tell me all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:28.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I’ll speak with Okiura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:31.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He wouldn’t listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:36.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, his father wouldn’t have any pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,His father?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m leaving for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:45.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I’ll be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:46.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t close down Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:53.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, that’s enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:55.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:05.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Does your stomach hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:07.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t get near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:09.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:11.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:17.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:24.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:26.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:28.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:38.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? It’s Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:40.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Takashi-niichan’s there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:46.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He suddenly collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:01.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:02.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,{13,0000,0000,0000,,06 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:32.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:38.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The ambulance was going beepo beepo, wasn’t it? {err, I forgot the English equivalent for this XD}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:39.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:40.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:42.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? This is Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:53.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Appendicitis?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:55.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:13:57.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:59.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll let Sayaka-sensei know too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:31.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:35.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The operation went well, so he’ll be all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:38.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:41.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, there’s nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:46.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:47.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:08.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:12.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:17.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That man… the one standing in front of the preschool…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.49,0:15:19.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He collapsed from appendicitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:21.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Appendicitis?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:23.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s in the central hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:25.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems the operation went okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:27.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.69,0:15:29.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve caused you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:32.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it really was a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:36.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then hurry and vacate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:38.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not like you’ll pay back the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:44.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t there any way to negotiate this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:46.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Negotiate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:51.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:54.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong? This isn’t like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:57.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m asking if you will or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I won’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.14,0:16:02.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, thanks for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:06.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:06.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:11.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You better give up and leave the preschool too, Kiyokazu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:38.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I even call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:42.98,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,600)}I’m sure he’ll understand if we tell him everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.19,0:16:46.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:51.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… that man’s all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:53.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems he’ll be healthy again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.65,0:16:55.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:09.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:11.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:15.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:17.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Rikako-chan said she’s leaving the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.05,0:17:20.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:28.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, that’s enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.02,0:17:30.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But there’s still cleaning to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:33.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You had a busy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:36.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You should go back and get a good rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.53,0:17:40.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll be busy with Christmas\Npreparations tomorrow, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:40.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:42.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:45.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll walk you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:46.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:50.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for everything today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:51.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:53.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t really help much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:55.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go get my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:18:00.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san, thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:04.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t get any confetti today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:05.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:10.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But that man’s going to get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:11.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:13.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:15.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If he gets better, he’ll just come here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:17.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:00.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.70,0:19:04.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san was… angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:08.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He told me not to do anything, but I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:12.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:13.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:20.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Want to sit somewhere for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:29.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:36.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If Yomogi Preschool closes, everyone will be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:51.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re always worried about the people around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:56.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kind, straightforward…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:20:00.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, you’re always working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:03.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:12.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I like girls like you, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:19.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:24.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to you, I feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:31.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:34.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:44.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:48.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:43.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:47.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:49.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:53.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,On Christmas Day…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:57.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.59,0:22:04.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:09.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,On your way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.09,0:22:11.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:12.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.97,0:22:16.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx(99)}If there’s anything else you need for the Christmas party, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:19.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:27.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for letting me use your scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.53,0:22:30.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll see you later, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.11,0:22:31.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:36.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.41,0:22:38.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…White Christmas.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
